            "id": "e14_feed_whiteboard",
            "situation": "A team photo at your desks, with a whiteboard of client names and go-live dates behind you.",
            "answer": "tweak",
            "reason": "Post the people, not the whiteboard. Client names and dates in the background are a free briefing for anyone watching."
